# Phase 1

Phase 1 is complete. The spec is `docs/phases/phase-1/phase-1-scope.md`. The completion record is `docs/phases/phase-1/phase-1-status.md`. Do not open a new Phase 1 stage.

A component plan may add detail. It may not drop a phase exit check, reorder stages, or pull in a later-phase domain.

Later-phase work starts from that phase's spec in `docs/phases/`. Do not add Phase 1 scope while doing it. Stop and flag a task that seems to need a domain the current phase spec leaves out.

Student accounts have two independent paths. Self-registration via `/auth/register` logs in with no admin approval. Admin-created accounts use a one-time activation code. An account grants login only.

No actor sets, sees, or resets another user's password. Deletes are Master Admin only, enforced in the API. Use the concrete values in `docs/phases/phase-1/phase-1-scope.md` unless Shahriar says otherwise.

Where that spec says "Section 9" for tests, use Section 11.

Mobile device checks run on Shahriar's physical Android phone. Run `flutter test` for widget tests. Do not install Android system images, create an AVD, or launch an emulator. Hand over `flutter run --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://<lan-ip>:8080` for the phone. The in-app default `http://10.0.2.2:8080` is only a URL string.
